<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean Scorpio - 50,000 tonnes urea Yuzhnyy/Bombay 27 June/2 July $20.50 fio 6,000/2,500 Indian Government.</p>
<p>Pratishtha - 25,000 tonnes urea Yuzhnyy/WC India 1/5 July $32 fio 6,000/1,200 option Kandla $31 1,500 Bombay $29 2,500</p>
